cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Detecting and Correcting Spatial Bias in VGI Using Remote Sensing"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end, reproducible pipeline that detects spatial bias in volunteered
  geographic information (OpenStreetMap) using USGS 3DEP LiDAR and NAIP imagery,
  quantifies it across all 102 Illinois counties, and corrects it with machine
  proposals validated against what the OSM community later mapped. Developed as
  Team 1 of the I-GUIDE Summer School 2026.
